# The documentation itself. Prettier MUST NOT format docs/.
#
# These pages are MkDocs-flavoured Markdown. MkDocs admonitions ("!!! note")
# carry their body in a four-space-indented block, which is not standard
# Markdown, so Prettier does not recognise it: it strips the indentation and
# reflows the body onto the "!!!" line. On docs/overview-guide/seven-phases.md
# that collapses the whole Flare Playbook into a single line that no longer
# renders as a list, and the same happens to every other phase admonition.
#
# This is not a width or wrapping setting that can be tuned - Prettier has no
# concept of the syntax - so docs/ is out of Prettier's scope entirely.
# lint_markdown_ultra.py is the format and lint gate for docs/. See LINTING.md.
docs/

